                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This has to be one of the best arcade racers to date. Insane destruction in environmental way and slighly in the cars.\r\n\r\nThere are 12 episodes, feels like 1 episode per month. No story just a unfortunate ending to the game, no spoilers though for it. \r\n\r\nThe soundtrack is a absolute blast. The gameplay is perfect, sometimes annoying but perfect. The driving is a bit weird, turning has a bit of TCS and slowness to it.\r\n\r\nI am so happy that I picked this game during a sale, sure the 30 fps is a annoyance to some but for me it wasn't even noticeable that much. Very awesome game all the way.",
